      "statement": "The celld-logic crate is a pure decision core: `on_event(state, event) -> Vec<Effect>` (logic/lib.rs:5215) is the only way behavioral state advances, no adapter may mutate State directly, and the crate declares no async, I/O, clocks, randomness, locks, or dependencies — which is what enables deterministic simulation.",
